chapter.v:
	By awesome 

	 deeds in righteousness You will answer us,O God of our salvation,You who are the confidence of all the ends of the earth,And of the far-off seas;
 [Is. 17:11; Jer. 51:33; Joel 3:13; Matt. 13:30]

	Who established 

	 the mountains by His strength,Being clothed with power;
 [Deut. 4:27; Is. 24:13; Obad.]
